WEBVTT

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:16.620
<i>Along a zigzag the world turns,</i>
<i>I heave out a sigh.</i>

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:27.640
<i>Someone pauses along the way,</i>
<i>but reality moves on.</i>

00:00:27.870 --> 00:00:33.170
<i>Treat love as love, treat</i>
<i>dreams as dreams.</i>

00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:38.680
<i>It's difficult to say it in earnest.</i>
<i>The times forge ahead, but...</i>

00:00:38.780 --> 00:00:43.650
<i>I want to make you happy...</i>

00:00:43.790 --> 00:00:49.380
<i>I'll do so like I do to</i>
<i>be myself. Yeah!</i>

00:00:49.490 --> 00:00:54.420
<i>I'll make you happy...</i>

00:00:54.530 --> 00:00:59.830
<i>I dedicate all that</i>
<i>I can do to you.</i>

00:00:59.930 --> 00:01:11.150
<i>Along a zigzag the world turns,</i>
<i>I heave out a sigh.</i>

00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:23.390
<i>Someone pauses along the way,</i>
<i>but love doesn't stop for me.</i>

00:01:44.850 --> 00:01:46.370
Watch it, Natsumi!

00:01:46.480 --> 00:01:48.570
You're revving
it too high!

00:01:48.680 --> 00:01:51.980
I'm telling you again, those pistons are
new and should be broken in gently!

00:01:52.390 --> 00:01:53.980
Yeah, yeah,
I hear ya!

00:01:57.990 --> 00:01:59.980
No, apparently not.

00:02:17.650 --> 00:02:22.550
FILE. 16
NAKAJIMA'S
DOUBLE?

00:02:26.990 --> 00:02:28.480
What's with this
showoff?!

00:02:31.690 --> 00:02:33.660
Stop! Natsumi!

00:02:46.570 --> 00:02:49.870
Don't be thinking you're
so hot, buddy!

00:02:53.580 --> 00:02:54.610
All right!

00:03:04.190 --> 00:03:07.160
You're gonna try and
pass me, huh?

00:03:17.870 --> 00:03:19.130
Later, pal!

00:03:27.980 --> 00:03:30.080
He's sure
got guts!

00:03:37.890 --> 00:03:39.480
Where'd he come
from?!

00:03:46.570 --> 00:03:48.470
Oh no!

00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:06.520
Oowiiee...

00:04:06.620 --> 00:04:09.520
Damn it!

00:04:09.620 --> 00:04:11.590
Uh, oh!

00:04:15.830 --> 00:04:16.800
You okay?

00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:19.660
S... Sure. Not a thing
wrong with me!

00:04:19.830 --> 00:04:20.800
Where'd that
Ducati go?

00:04:20.970 --> 00:04:22.940
Over there.

00:04:25.110 --> 00:04:27.010
I know I've seen someone
ride like that before.

00:04:27.180 --> 00:04:29.970
I know. I was just thinking
the same thing.

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:35.550
Nakajima?

00:04:41.820 --> 00:04:44.790
That's why I told you to
go easy on the engine!

00:04:45.530 --> 00:04:47.260
The pistons
are fried...

00:04:47.360 --> 00:04:50.530
...and now there's a crack
in the crankcase!

00:04:50.630 --> 00:04:52.720
I won't be able to fix every-
thing in a day or two!

00:04:52.900 --> 00:04:54.030
Sorry!

00:04:54.200 --> 00:04:57.170
You'd better learn from your mistakes and
start changing your driving habits!

00:04:57.340 --> 00:04:58.610
Yes, ma'am!

00:04:58.610 --> 00:05:00.570
Oh, man!

00:05:00.740 --> 00:05:02.610
You wouldn't believe how backed
up the Mito Expressway is!

00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:03.750
Hey, Nakajima!

00:05:03.750 --> 00:05:04.180
Yeah?

00:05:04.180 --> 00:05:05.870
Did you go to Hakone this morning?

00:05:06.050 --> 00:05:08.410
Hakone? To the
hot springs?

00:05:08.580 --> 00:05:10.520
Maybe it wasn't
him...

00:05:10.690 --> 00:05:14.850
Of course it wasn't. He wouldn't
just take off and not tell us.

00:05:15.020 --> 00:05:16.320
Why? What's
this about?

00:05:16.490 --> 00:05:21.390
We were riding at Hakone when a black
Ducati nearly ran me off the road!

00:05:21.560 --> 00:05:23.930
A black Ducati?

00:05:24.030 --> 00:05:25.830
Was it a 900 SS?

00:05:25.830 --> 00:05:28.460
Yeah! How did you know?

00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:30.540
A black SS,
you say...

00:05:31.410 --> 00:05:32.930
So you know
who it is?

00:05:33.110 --> 00:05:36.200
What? Oh uh, no,
nevermind!

00:05:36.440 --> 00:05:40.640
Hey! Did you hear that Nakajima
quit the Bokuto station?

00:05:41.050 --> 00:05:45.220
What?!

00:05:45.390 --> 00:05:48.450
Huh? Nakajima! What
are you doing here?

00:05:48.690 --> 00:05:52.680
So apparently he was only here
because he likes motorbikes.

00:05:52.860 --> 00:05:56.300
Yeah, but quitting to become
a motorcycle courier...

00:05:56.460 --> 00:06:00.530
Maybe his heart's into highway
racing, and only that.

00:06:00.700 --> 00:06:04.640
Anyway, I never thought that guy
had what it takes to be a cop.

00:06:04.810 --> 00:06:07.040
I can't believe he didn't
say anything to us.

00:06:07.140 --> 00:06:10.010
So much for being
his friends.

00:06:10.180 --> 00:06:12.740
How do these rumors
get started, anyway?

00:06:12.910 --> 00:06:15.380
Na... Nakajima!

00:06:15.550 --> 00:06:17.540
W... What are you doing
in your uniform?

00:06:17.720 --> 00:06:18.580
Huh?

00:06:18.750 --> 00:06:22.090
Didn't you try to run me off the road
on some black Ducati just now?!

00:06:22.590 --> 00:06:26.720
I believe we saw the
same bike as well.

00:06:26.890 --> 00:06:30.960
<i>A black SS and a guy that rides like</i>
<i>me? There's only one possibility.</i>

00:06:31.430 --> 00:06:36.930
Nakajima, we thought you'd quit and were
working as a motorcycle courier.

00:06:37.170 --> 00:06:42.070
I see. So everybody saw the guy on a
black Ducati who rides like Nakajima?

00:06:42.280 --> 00:06:43.070
Yeah.

00:06:43.240 --> 00:06:47.310
No. He didn't just look like Nakajima.
He was Nakajima. I'm positive.

00:06:47.480 --> 00:06:49.850
Me three!

00:06:50.020 --> 00:06:51.520
Hey? Where's Nakajima?

00:06:51.520 --> 00:06:52.820
He just left.

00:06:52.820 --> 00:06:55.580
Why didn't you try and stop him?!

00:06:55.760 --> 00:06:57.920
Now it'll be that much harder
to solve this mystery!

00:06:58.090 --> 00:06:58.890
"Mystery?"

00:06:59.060 --> 00:07:04.230
I know! Nakajima's got a twin brother
who was separated at birth!

00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:08.100
Know what I think? I think he
can astrally project his spirit!

00:07:08.270 --> 00:07:12.430
Or maybe he was once
abducted by aliens...

00:07:12.610 --> 00:07:13.770
See?

00:07:13.770 --> 00:07:16.400
Y... Yeah.

00:07:19.650 --> 00:07:22.950
<i>Where is he?! Where</i>
<i>is he hiding?!</i>

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:26.220
Where are you
hiding?!

00:07:29.720 --> 00:07:32.420
Nakajima didn't come
back today, did he?

00:07:32.530 --> 00:07:35.160
At the station, the theories are
getting weirder and weirder.

00:07:35.260 --> 00:07:39.700
Some suggest there's a Nakajima robot;
others insist that he's been cloned!

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:43.700
Everybody loves juicy
gossip, don't they?!

00:07:44.310 --> 00:07:47.070
Get off of it, Miyuki. You're wondering
about it as much as everyone else.

00:07:47.170 --> 00:07:49.200
Especially 'cause
it's Nakajima!

00:07:49.640 --> 00:07:54.210
I... I am not! There's nothing at
all between the two of us!

00:07:54.480 --> 00:07:56.450
Well, excuse me!

00:08:03.060 --> 00:08:05.690
<i>That's the same blue</i>
<i>Toyota hatchback...</i>

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:09.060
Why don't you just
quit pretending?!

00:08:09.160 --> 00:08:12.060
If you don't do anything, it'll
take gazillions of years!

00:08:12.230 --> 00:08:15.070
I told you, gazillions
isn't a number...

00:08:19.770 --> 00:08:21.400
Th... That's him!

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:26.710
There he is! He must've been tearing
around here since this morning.

00:08:31.920 --> 00:08:33.290
Hold on tight, Natsumi!

00:08:33.290 --> 00:08:34.080
Okay!

00:08:44.270 --> 00:08:47.390
<i>I see. Very tight</i>
<i>driving...</i>

00:08:47.570 --> 00:08:49.970
<i>... and very minimal</i>
<i>countersteering.</i>

00:08:53.310 --> 00:08:55.980
Huh?

00:09:05.490 --> 00:09:07.150
That was too
close!

00:09:07.320 --> 00:09:09.590
There's no mistake
about it!

00:09:09.760 --> 00:09:11.280
Huh?

00:09:11.460 --> 00:09:13.860
Judging by the
way he rides...

00:09:13.960 --> 00:09:15.950
It's got to be
Nakajima!

00:09:16.560 --> 00:09:20.470
<i>Pretty good driving for an old</i>
<i>car like that! However...</i>

00:09:20.800 --> 00:09:21.830
Uh...

00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:23.970
Oh no!

00:09:27.110 --> 00:09:28.440
He's getting
away!

00:09:28.610 --> 00:09:30.040
Just leave him
to me!

00:09:30.210 --> 00:09:31.610
Wha?

00:09:34.280 --> 00:09:36.250
It's Nakajima!

00:09:38.190 --> 00:09:41.990
<i>So it wasn't Nakajima riding</i>
<i>the Ducati, after all.</i>

00:09:51.070 --> 00:09:53.030
He's on
him!

00:09:54.700 --> 00:09:57.000
Hey! Pull over
this instant!

00:09:58.070 --> 00:10:00.560
Stop, Dad!

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:02.710
"Dad?!"

00:10:08.680 --> 00:10:10.580
So you knew,
huh?

00:10:11.520 --> 00:10:14.580
You were the one who taught
me how to ride a motorcycle.

00:10:15.160 --> 00:10:17.620
Of course I'm going
to know who it is.

00:10:17.790 --> 00:10:18.780
It's his
Dad!

00:10:18.960 --> 00:10:20.590
What are you trying
to say?

00:10:29.240 --> 00:10:31.670
Sorry about that little
stunt in Hakone.

00:10:31.770 --> 00:10:34.040
I haven't had that much
fun in ages.

00:10:34.210 --> 00:10:36.540
No problem. Don't
mention it.

00:10:36.640 --> 00:10:38.310
Hurry up, Miyuki! Introduce
yourself!

00:10:38.480 --> 00:10:39.670
Wha?

00:10:39.850 --> 00:10:42.680
Dad! What are you doing
around here?

00:10:42.850 --> 00:10:46.980
Well, Son, I'm thinking about maybe
opening up a motorcycle shop.

00:10:47.190 --> 00:10:51.820
Huh? But Dad, you're not really good
at dealing with customers!

00:10:52.390 --> 00:10:55.560
Nevermind, Son.
Don't you worry.

00:10:55.660 --> 00:11:01.760
I heard you were seeing someone at work,
so I came to find out if it was true.

00:11:01.940 --> 00:11:03.400
Huh?

00:11:03.570 --> 00:11:04.560
Um...

00:11:05.640 --> 00:11:10.600
If a girl's to marry into a racing family like
ours, she must have exceptional skills.

00:11:11.080 --> 00:11:13.240
M... Marry?!

00:11:13.410 --> 00:11:16.440
That driving back there...
It was very impressive.

00:11:16.620 --> 00:11:18.590
Uh... um.

00:11:18.750 --> 00:11:22.280
Please take my
son's hand.

00:11:22.390 --> 00:11:23.980
I'm depending
on you.

00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:33.900
What? Me?!

00:11:42.940 --> 00:11:47.180
Yahoo! This
is easy!

00:11:47.850 --> 00:11:49.750
I can see why my
son chose you!

00:11:49.850 --> 00:11:52.410
Look how well you've
learned to ride it!

00:11:52.590 --> 00:11:57.350
I keep telling you. There's nothing
going on between us.

00:11:58.330 --> 00:12:00.120
What do I have to say to
make you believe me?

00:12:00.290 --> 00:12:04.730
I understand. You just say that because
he won't express his true feelings.

00:12:04.930 --> 00:12:07.300
Well, that part's true, I suppose.

00:12:07.300 --> 00:12:07.870
Yeah.

00:12:07.870 --> 00:12:09.700
Huh?

00:12:10.370 --> 00:12:15.670
It's not what it looks like.
Right, Dad? Oops!

00:12:20.850 --> 00:12:24.310
Good punch! That's the kind of woman
my son would fall in love with!

00:12:24.690 --> 00:12:26.650
Oh, no!

00:12:28.420 --> 00:12:32.980
Oops, this is the
rag for my bike.

00:12:33.160 --> 00:12:35.860
Well, it's just the thing
for bikers like us!

00:12:36.030 --> 00:12:38.070
R... Really?

00:12:38.070 --> 00:12:40.170
Heh, well I, er...

00:12:40.170 --> 00:12:43.300
Gee, looks like your Dad
sure has taken a liking
to Natsumi, doesn't it? Heh, well I, er...

00:12:43.300 --> 00:12:43.440
Really? Is
that so?
Heh, well I, er...

00:12:43.440 --> 00:12:43.940
Yeah... Really? Is

00:12:43.940 --> 00:12:44.070
that so?

00:12:44.070 --> 00:12:44.640
It's true!

00:12:44.640 --> 00:12:44.770
Really? Is

00:12:44.770 --> 00:12:49.180
Not many Fathers would
forgive someone for doing
something so coarse. It's true!

00:12:49.180 --> 00:12:49.310
Oh, you! Dad.

00:12:49.310 --> 00:12:50.510
Who knows? Maybe
this is Natsumi's
big chance.

00:12:50.510 --> 00:12:51.680
Am I cool, orwhat?!

00:12:51.680 --> 00:12:51.810
Oh, you! Dad.
Am I cool, orwhat?!

00:12:51.810 --> 00:12:52.650
Oh, what a mess! Once Dad
finds someone he likes, he Oh, you! Dad.
refuses to let them go!

00:12:52.650 --> 00:12:52.780
refuses to let them go!

00:12:52.780 --> 00:12:56.510
Oh, what a mess! Once Dad Is that so...
finds someone he likes, he Well...
refuses to let them go!

00:12:57.050 --> 00:13:00.380
Your RZ is in for repairs
for awhile, isn't it?

00:13:00.490 --> 00:13:02.890
Why don't you use my bike
until yours is fixed?

00:13:03.060 --> 00:13:06.030
Really? Thanks, Pops!

00:13:06.190 --> 00:13:08.990
Pops? How about calling
me Daimaru?

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:10.860
Daimaru Nakajima.

00:13:11.030 --> 00:13:14.260
Okay! Daimaru it is! And
you can call me Natsumi.

00:13:14.700 --> 00:13:17.830
He's gonna lend her
his beloved SS?!

00:13:17.940 --> 00:13:20.170
This is really getting
out of hand!

00:13:20.340 --> 00:13:23.240
Can you say "No" to the woman
your dad's chosen for you?

00:13:23.410 --> 00:13:25.540
W... Why you!

00:13:26.310 --> 00:13:27.480
I'm leaving.

00:13:27.480 --> 00:13:29.450
K... Kobayakawa!

00:13:31.250 --> 00:13:32.550
You leaving?

00:13:32.550 --> 00:13:34.490
Yep. See ya.

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:36.250
Wait... Wait
a second!

00:13:39.090 --> 00:13:42.890
That model Ducati tends to
choke at low speeds...

00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:46.830
...so it's a good idea to open up
the pilot screw about halfway.

00:13:51.070 --> 00:13:54.910
<i>She hasn't even driven it, but she can</i>
<i>tell by the sound of the engine.</i>

00:13:55.110 --> 00:13:57.600
"Women's Locker Room"

00:14:05.450 --> 00:14:06.980
I don't believe
you.

00:14:07.690 --> 00:14:10.490
All this time, and you still
can't tell each other.

00:14:12.030 --> 00:14:14.260
Aren't you both getting
tired of this?

00:14:14.430 --> 00:14:16.860
What do you mean? There's
nothing between us.

00:14:17.030 --> 00:14:21.490
Is that a fact? Well in that case, maybe
I'll just marry Nakajima myself.

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:24.730
And his father
likes me, too.

00:14:26.440 --> 00:14:33.180
Um... Hello?! Even if it's just an air gun,
pointing it at people isn't a good idea.

00:14:33.350 --> 00:14:36.370
Oops! Sorry. It was totally
unconscious.

00:14:36.550 --> 00:14:38.250
Was it now?

00:14:41.720 --> 00:14:45.820
I can't say I really want to continue
going on like this, though.

00:14:46.160 --> 00:14:48.460
See? I knew you'd
see it my way!

00:14:48.560 --> 00:14:51.930
That's great! This'll be a snap
to fix! There is hope yet!

00:14:52.600 --> 00:14:58.000
Wait and see! I'll make that idiot Nakajima
realize who his one and only true love is!

00:15:02.440 --> 00:15:04.910
Stop it! Quit that squirming
around!

00:15:05.080 --> 00:15:07.710
I've had enough of this,
Dad. Let's stop!

00:15:08.320 --> 00:15:13.620
We've been at it for two hours now! I'm
so hungry, I'm starting to get dizzy!

00:15:13.790 --> 00:15:18.620
We're not quitting. If you can't take the
heat, I can't teach you all of my stunts.

00:15:18.790 --> 00:15:22.460
How do you expect me to do
stunts on a police bike?!

00:15:22.630 --> 00:15:24.700
Nakajima? Are you in?

00:15:24.700 --> 00:15:25.970
Tsujimoto?

00:15:25.970 --> 00:15:27.800
Oh, it's Natsumi!

00:15:28.200 --> 00:15:29.640
"Be careful with fire"
Evening.

00:15:29.640 --> 00:15:32.040
Sorry for dropping
by so late.
"Be careful with fire"

00:15:32.040 --> 00:15:32.210
"Be careful with fire"

00:15:32.210 --> 00:15:32.760
Wha?

00:15:32.940 --> 00:15:34.910
W... What brings you
here tonight?

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:39.880
Miyuki wants to hear your honest
feelings, Nakajima.

00:15:40.510 --> 00:15:41.950
She... what?!

00:15:41.950 --> 00:15:44.780
Natsumi! Please! Stop this!

00:15:44.950 --> 00:15:50.360
It'll be fine! So, Nakajima, what
is it? Well? Tell her!

00:15:50.560 --> 00:15:53.250
Okay.

00:15:53.730 --> 00:15:54.790
Huh?

00:15:54.960 --> 00:15:56.520
Okay, I...

00:15:56.700 --> 00:15:59.930
Come on! You can
do it, Nakajima!

00:16:00.100 --> 00:16:01.170
I... I...

00:16:01.170 --> 00:16:04.140
Tell her! And your Father, too!

00:16:04.140 --> 00:16:04.270
I... I...

00:16:04.270 --> 00:16:10.010
Tell her your feelings! Be a man!

00:16:10.910 --> 00:16:13.000
I'm hungry.

00:16:14.250 --> 00:16:22.420
He lacks sensitivity, which is why he
needs a tolerant woman like you.

00:16:22.520 --> 00:16:24.650
Please bear
with him.

00:16:24.830 --> 00:16:26.590
Pardon?

00:16:31.730 --> 00:16:34.000
What do you want to
show me so badly?

00:16:34.170 --> 00:16:36.930
It doesn't matter. Just
follow our car.

00:16:37.270 --> 00:16:42.270
Look! You've got to show him your strong
points. This is your last chance!

00:16:42.440 --> 00:16:44.710
I don't feel like going
through with this.

00:16:44.880 --> 00:16:49.680
If that's how you're going to be, it really
will take gazillions of years!

00:16:50.650 --> 00:16:51.750
You're right, it will.

00:16:51.750 --> 00:16:52.880
You're right, it will.
Huh?

00:16:57.220 --> 00:16:58.820
<i>It's running much</i>
<i>better.</i>

00:17:01.130 --> 00:17:03.260
<i>Did she do</i>
<i>that?</i>

00:17:03.660 --> 00:17:05.560
So? What do
we do now?

00:17:05.730 --> 00:17:07.220
The one thing
we can do!

00:17:07.330 --> 00:17:11.270
Find people breaking traffic
laws, and bust them!

00:17:11.370 --> 00:17:14.340
We're gonna show
off your talents!

00:17:16.780 --> 00:17:18.750
Just as I thought.

00:17:19.150 --> 00:17:22.080
It's not as if people around here are
rampantly breaking the law. Right?

00:17:24.020 --> 00:17:27.780
Hey! Are you the guy I hear has been
speeding around on a Ducati?

00:17:28.790 --> 00:17:33.160
I don't know about speeding, but a young
pip-squeak like you won't beat me.

00:17:33.330 --> 00:17:37.090
Eh? Let's see you
try and beat me!

00:17:46.310 --> 00:17:49.070
Hey. They've started
racing.

00:17:49.240 --> 00:17:51.210
Looks like it.

00:18:02.790 --> 00:18:07.490
<i>Seems like that Miyuki girl knows</i>
<i>what she's doing, too.</i>

00:18:08.130 --> 00:18:12.220
<i>He sure knows how to handle that</i>
<i>bike. That old man is something!</i>

00:18:12.970 --> 00:18:15.590
<i>And he's so young</i>
<i>for his age.</i>

00:18:18.140 --> 00:18:20.000
<i>What's with that</i>
<i>cop car?</i>

00:18:20.110 --> 00:18:23.910
<i>How can it still be following</i>
<i>us? Damn!</i>

00:18:24.340 --> 00:18:26.110
<i>Who do you think you're</i>
<i>up against?</i>

00:18:30.750 --> 00:18:33.050
<i>What do you think</i>
<i>of this, huh?</i>

00:18:33.220 --> 00:18:35.420
I'm right behind
you, kid!

00:18:46.170 --> 00:18:47.960
<i>Are these people for</i>
<i>real, or what?!</i>

00:19:02.480 --> 00:19:04.950
<i>No way they can follow me</i>
<i>down this straight-away!</i>

00:19:05.120 --> 00:19:07.990
Hey, hey! Did you
miss me, kid?

00:19:10.220 --> 00:19:14.020
<i>Those two won't be able to</i>
<i>keep up in their little car.</i>

00:19:14.260 --> 00:19:15.360
Are you ready?

00:19:15.360 --> 00:19:16.260
Of course!

00:19:16.260 --> 00:19:18.030
Nitro, on!

00:19:24.100 --> 00:19:24.730
What?

00:19:32.950 --> 00:19:34.150
Hiya boys!

00:19:34.150 --> 00:19:35.010
Huh?!

00:19:35.180 --> 00:19:37.080
How about you
stop racing?

00:19:37.250 --> 00:19:40.580
One of you will just end
up having an accident.

00:19:40.750 --> 00:19:46.490
<i>Handling such a hot rod that</i>
<i>well requires some real skill.</i>

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:49.130
<i>Now's my</i>
<i>chance.</i>

00:19:50.630 --> 00:19:52.000
Oh no!

00:20:00.270 --> 00:20:02.330
Are you okay?

00:20:02.510 --> 00:20:05.810
Just a little rattled. I
must be getting old.

00:20:06.380 --> 00:20:07.910
Natsumi! Go get him!

00:20:07.910 --> 00:20:08.720
Me? But?

00:20:08.720 --> 00:20:09.880
It's okay!

00:20:09.880 --> 00:20:11.940
Daimaru! Can I take your bike?

00:20:12.120 --> 00:20:14.090
Yeah.

00:20:16.360 --> 00:20:20.550
<i>I'm not the one who's supposed</i>
<i>to be showing off here.</i>

00:20:27.300 --> 00:20:29.200
Sorry about that...

00:20:29.300 --> 00:20:32.070
I scratched your
beloved car.

00:20:32.310 --> 00:20:35.300
Scratches can be
easily fixed.

00:20:36.840 --> 00:20:38.740
But...

00:20:38.850 --> 00:20:43.810
It's lives that are precious.
They can't be repaired.

00:20:48.260 --> 00:20:52.950
Now promise me you'll stop
racing like that... Father.

00:20:56.660 --> 00:21:00.160
<i>It's nice to be called</i>
<i>Father.</i>

00:21:00.270 --> 00:21:03.530
<i>Especially by this</i>
<i>young woman.</i>

00:21:06.940 --> 00:21:10.640
It sure was tough catching that biker,
it seemed like he had a death wish.

00:21:10.810 --> 00:21:14.610
Geez, Dad! Think
about your age!

00:21:15.350 --> 00:21:20.550
Alright already. I've thought about my
age and now I'll tell you my decision.

00:21:20.920 --> 00:21:22.720
What decision?

00:21:23.360 --> 00:21:25.480
I'm going to leave you
in Miyuki's hands.

00:21:25.660 --> 00:21:27.290
Wha?

00:21:27.460 --> 00:21:29.690
Congratulations,
Nakajima!

00:21:29.860 --> 00:21:32.730
And I'm gonna keep Natsumi
here for myself.

00:21:32.900 --> 00:21:33.920
Huh?

00:21:34.070 --> 00:21:37.300
You... you mean to tell me she's
gonna be my mother?!

00:21:37.640 --> 00:21:38.870
Oh! That's
right!

00:21:39.040 --> 00:21:41.010
Come on! Knock
it off!

00:21:42.610 --> 00:21:43.410
Oops.

00:21:43.580 --> 00:21:45.510
Father! Father!

00:21:45.680 --> 00:21:48.340
Oh! I... l'm terribly
sorry!

00:21:48.520 --> 00:21:48.880
I'm fine!

00:21:48.880 --> 00:21:50.850
I'm fine!
Oh no...

00:22:05.870 --> 00:22:11.440
<i>I live my life my own way, doing</i>
<i>things others wouldn't.</i>

00:22:11.710 --> 00:22:20.050
<i>Being strong isn't enough.</i>
<i>It makes me Ionely.</i>

00:22:22.750 --> 00:22:31.060
<i>I can feel your presence</i>
<i>as if you're right here...</i>

00:22:31.590 --> 00:22:39.160
<i>... but I can't say a word.</i>

00:22:40.700 --> 00:22:47.900
<i>The feelings I hide within might</i>
<i>break into pieces...</i>

00:22:49.440 --> 00:22:56.820
<i>But if I don't say anything,</i>
<i>nothing can begin.</i>

00:22:57.150 --> 00:23:04.380
<i>The wind gently blows...</i>
<i>Time flows...</i>

00:23:04.560 --> 00:23:14.100
<i>Time flows... And soon</i>
<i>I can be honest...</i>

00:23:14.230 --> 00:23:17.200
<i>Thank you,</i>
<i>friend!</i>

00:23:23.410 --> 00:23:25.310
"The Lady In Yellow"

00:23:25.910 --> 00:23:28.940
I can't call her "Mom"
or "Mother."

00:23:29.120 --> 00:23:30.810
Nakajima, what are you
mumbling about?

00:23:30.980 --> 00:23:32.180
Kobayakawa! Er, nothin'!

00:23:32.350 --> 00:23:35.250
You said "Mother" or something.
Do you have a Mother Complex?

00:23:35.420 --> 00:23:36.390
It's not what you think.

00:23:36.390 --> 00:23:38.690
It's not what you think.
I don't know, looks like it to me!

00:23:38.860 --> 00:23:40.420
Oh, so you have a perverted
Mother Complex?

00:23:40.590 --> 00:23:43.060
Let me reconsider
our relationship.

00:23:43.230 --> 00:23:44.660
Not you too, Kobayakawa!

00:23:44.830 --> 00:23:48.200
Next time on You're Under Arrest, File
17, "That 20-Year-Old Is My Mother!"

00:23:48.340 --> 00:23:50.340
She's only 20! 20!
